# Bees Motion deploy workflow

After completing requested website changes in this repo (`meklads/beesmotion`):

1. **Commit** with a clear message (HEREDOC) when there are relevant changes.
2. **Push to GitHub** on `main` with `git push origin main` immediately. Never ask "should I push?".
3. **Deployment is automatic.** `.github/workflows/deploy.yml` publishes every push to `main` to Cloudflare Pages (project `beesmotion`). Do not run `npm run deploy` locally unless the workflow is broken.

Do not leave finished work only local. If push or the deploy workflow fails, fix and retry or tell the user why.
